<title>POLAND: Bank Handlowy sells Polish aircraft maker CPs.</title>
<headline>Bank Handlowy sells Polish aircraft maker CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Handlowy sold 7.46 million zlotys of commercial papers for Polish aircraft maker, WSK PZL Swidnik SA, the bank said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement Swidnik's CPs, which mature on November 29, 1996 were sold with a maximum yield of 18.93 percent. The average yield was 18.89 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
